-- (2) The review "no later than the first anniversary of the day on which this section comes into force"; the report "within 180 days after that first anniversary and every five years thereafter".
-- The coming-into-force day is not in the text (it is an input). "every five years thereafter" is read as: a report is due within 180 days after the first anniversary and within 180 days
-- after each fifth anniversary of that first anniversary (fork F-ccc3-8).
-- COVERS: fork F-ccc3-8 | s 83.0392(2) the last day for the comprehensive review; s 83.0392(2) the last day for the nth report | s 83.0392(2)
-- src:1438 | Comprehensive review and report
-- src:1439 | (2) A comprehensive review of sections 83.031 to 83.0391 and their operation must be conducted by the Public Safety Minister no later than the first anniversary of the day on which this section comes into force. The Public Safety Minister must cause a report to be laid before each House of Parliament within 180 days after that first anniversary and every five years thereafter.
@ref s 83.0392(2) (src:1438-1439)
GIVEN `the day on which this section comes into force` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DATE
`s 83.0392(2) the last day for the comprehensive review` MEANS `add years` `the day on which this section comes into force` 1

@ref s 83.0392(2) (src:1438-1439)
GIVEN `the day on which this section comes into force` IS A DATE
      `which report, counting the first as 0` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DATE
`s 83.0392(2) the last day for the nth report` MEANS
    (`add years` (`s 83.0392(2) the last day for the comprehensive review` `the day on which this section comes into force`) (5 TIMES `which report, counting the first as 0`)) PLUS 180

-- COVERS: fork F-ccc3-6 | s 83.0392(3) the report must include a plan and a timeline | s 83.0392(3)
-- src:1440 | Plan to remedy deficiencies
-- src:1441 | (3) If the report identifies any deficiencies in sections 83.031 to 83.0391 or their operation, the report must include a plan to remedy those deficiencies — including any proposed legislative amendments — and a timeline for its implementation.
@ref s 83.0392(3) (src:1440-1441)
GIVEN `the report identifies any deficiencies in sections 83.031 to 83.0391 or their operation` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the report includes a plan to remedy those deficiencies, including any proposed legislative amendments` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the report includes a timeline for its implementation` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 83.0392(3) the report must include a plan and a timeline` MEANS
    IF NOT `the report identifies any deficiencies in sections 83.031 to 83.0391 or their operation`
    THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "If the report identifies any deficiencies in sections 83.031 to 83.0391 or their operation"
    ELSE IF `the report includes a plan to remedy those deficiencies, including any proposed legislative amendments` AND `the report includes a timeline for its implementation`
         THEN JUST TRUE
         ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "the report must include a plan to remedy those deficiencies"
